<section class="install-page" aria-labelledby="install-title" data-install-page>
  <header class="install-intro">
    <p class="install-kicker">BUY. TRADE. DIG.</p>
    <h1 id="install-title">Take The Vinyl Drop with you.</h1>
    <p class="install-lede">Add the website to your home screen or desktop. It opens in its own window, just like an app — no app store, separate download or new account needed.</p>
    <div class="install-actions">
      <button class="btn btn-primary btn-md" type="button" data-install-action hidden>Install The Vinyl Drop</button>
      <button class="btn btn-outline btn-md" type="button" data-share-action>Share this page</button>
      <a class="install-marketplace-link" href="/">Or go straight to the marketplace</a>
    </div>
    <p class="install-status" data-install-status role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
    <div class="install-copy-fallback" data-copy-fallback hidden>
      <label for="install-share-url">Your install link</label>
      <input id="install-share-url" type="url" value="<%= installUrl %>" readonly data-install-share-url>
      <p>Copy this link and paste it into WhatsApp, email or any other app.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="install-layout">
    <section class="install-instructions" aria-labelledby="install-steps-title">
      <p class="install-section-label">ONE WEBSITE. YOUR DEVICE.</p>
      <h2 id="install-steps-title">Install in a few taps</h2>

      <div class="install-platform">
        <div class="install-platform-number" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Android</h3>
          <p>Open this page in Chrome. When the <strong>Install The Vinyl Drop</strong> button appears above, tap it and confirm. You can also use Chrome’s menu and choose <strong>Install app</strong> or <strong>Add to Home screen</strong> when offered.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="install-platform">
        <div class="install-platform-number" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
        <div>
          <h3>iPhone or iPad</h3>
          <p>Open this page in <strong>Safari</strong>. Tap the <strong>Share</strong> icon, scroll down and choose <strong>Add to Home Screen</strong>, then tap <strong>Add</strong>. Leave <strong>Open as Web App</strong> enabled when that option is shown.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="install-platform">
        <div class="install-platform-number" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Desktop</h3>
          <p>In a supported browser such as Chrome or Edge, use the install icon in the address bar or the browser menu’s install option. On macOS Safari, use <strong>File → Add to Dock</strong>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="install-note">The install button is provided only when your browser offers its native install prompt. If it does not appear, use the browser instructions above. The iPhone and iPad steps are handled by Safari itself.</p>
    </section>

    <aside class="install-qr-panel" aria-labelledby="install-qr-title">
      <p class="install-section-label">PASS IT ON</p>
      <h2 id="install-qr-title">Open it on another device</h2>
      <img class="install-qr-image" src="/assets/install-qr.svg" width="296" height="296" alt="QR code linking to https://thevinyldrop.nl/install">
      <p>Scan this code with the camera on the device you want to use.</p>
      <a class="install-qr-url" href="https://thevinyldrop.nl/install">thevinyldrop.nl/install</a>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <section class="install-footnote" aria-labelledby="install-details-title">
    <h2 id="install-details-title">What gets installed?</h2>
    <p>It is still The Vinyl Drop website — your listings, account and community stay in one place. The icon simply gives you a quick way back, and the app-style window keeps the browser frame out of the way. You can remove it from your device whenever you like.</p>
  </section>
</section>
